  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed commercial use within a residential area would be contrary to the aims and objectives of Local Plan Policies CC1, TC3, TC5 wherein businesses are directed to town and neighbourhood centres in the interests of their continued vitality and viability and would be harmful to the residential character of the area",
    "Reason : 2 - The creation of a separate front entrance on the side extension would be harmful to the character and appearance of the area, being specifically referred to in the Hounslow Residential Extension Guidelines and would be contrary to Local Plan Policies CC2 and SC7",
    "Reason : 3 - Through absence of information regarding numbers of customers and hours of operation, it has not been demonstrated that the proposal would have an acceptable impact upon neighbouring living conditions through additional noise and disturbance and is contrary to Local Plan Policies CC2 and EQ5",
    "Reason : 4 - Through absence of information regarding numbers of customers, staff and customer travel arrangement, operating hours and provision of onsite parking the proposal fails to demonstrate that adverse impact or the transport network would be avoided contrary to Local Plan Policy EC2"
  ],
